# Do not bump versions in feature changes

Do **not** change `MARKETING_VERSION` or `CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION` in `project.yml` as part of feature, fix, refactor, UI or provider pull requests.

Versions are bumped only by `scripts/publish-release.sh prepare <version>` (see `RELEASING.md`), which creates the release branch and PR.

Instead, note user-facing changes for `CHANGELOG.md`; the release flow requires a `## v<version>` section there (added when preparing the release).
